graph TD

  %% Clases
  Actor[Actor] -->|subClassOf| Entity[Entity]
  Zone[Zone] -->|subClassOf| Entity[Entity]
  Artifact[Artifact] -->|subClassOf| Entity[Entity]
  Process[Process] -->|subClassOf| Entity[Entity]
  LLMAgent[LLMAgent] -->|subClassOf| Actor[Actor]
  HumanAgent[HumanAgent] -->|subClassOf| Actor[Actor]
  CLI[CLI] -->|subClassOf| Actor[Actor]
  FileSystem[FileSystem] -->|subClassOf| Zone[Zone]
  Database[Database] -->|subClassOf| Zone[Zone]
  LogicSpace[LogicSpace] -->|subClassOf| Zone[Zone]
  Document[Document] -->|subClassOf| Artifact[Artifact]
  CodeModule[CodeModule] -->|subClassOf| Artifact[Artifact]
  DataModel[DataModel] -->|subClassOf| Artifact[Artifact]
  Algorithm[Algorithm] -->|subClassOf| Process[Process]
